{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065424/block/singleImage/3276444/df/01M8668MJD3DPG0KDP057FV5RC.jpg?updatedAt=1795504277\"/><figcaption>慈雲山有學生被車撞倒。（fb「慈雲山資訊交流」圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>慈雲山有學生被車撞倒。 今日（24日）中午12時40分，一名17歲男學生於慈雲山道8號德愛中學對開橫過安全島時遭一輛Tesla電動車撞倒。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，他背部及左手受傷，由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。警方正在調查事故原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.930122+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:11:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T04:57:18.772717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:17.960595+00:00","content_hash":"29a93d99695912d6fcf0eaaa80be3af87c363c6f07dd02aaad5679134e4a884f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.930122+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}